on about the time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the Wh-question word <span class=\"italic\"> when</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are different ways to say the time. Look at the chart below. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"05\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"noon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"12 o'clock in the afternoon.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's noon. I'm hungry. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"12 o'clock at night.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's midnight. I have to go to sleep. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a.m.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"use this to talk about time between midnight and noon.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">School starts at 9 a.m. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"p.m.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"use this to talk about time between noon and midnight.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have dinner at 8 p.m. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"o'clock\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" use this to tell the hour\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> It's 5 o'clock. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann </span>:     What time is it?<br /><span class=\"strong\">Tom </span>:      It's  5 p.m."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann </span>: When is the meeting?<br /><span cla